<title>USA: Duke boosts qtly div to $0.55/shr from $0.53.</title>
<headline>Duke boosts qtly div to $0.55/shr from $0.53.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duke Energy Corp said Monday it increased its quarterly cash dividend on its common stock to $0.55 a share from $0.53 a share.</p>
<p>The energy company said it will pay the dividend September 16 to shareholders of record on August 15. It added it will also pay quarterly dividend on its preferred stock September 16 to holders of record on August 15.</p>
